         <documentation id="documentation_05dcb08a-1cf0-406c-b875-988e56c779be"><![CDATA[Producer: Settlement Operations.
 
Consumers: Fund Accounting and NAV Operations; assigned exception owner; relevant control and support teams.
 
Content: Exception notification, affected population details, source extracts, control results, investigation notes, communications, decisions and supporting evidence.
 
Purpose: Supports materiality assessment, NAV-related decision-making, exception ownership and retention of the evidence required for subsequent recovery or escalation.]]></documentation>
