                            dataObjectRef="_08812c16-2987-419a-956a-232b1f770254">
         <documentation id="documentation_08812c16-2987-419a-956a-232b1f770254"><![CDATA[Available SYS-SET results for the submitted settlemen instructions. Contains a separate instruction identifier for each created instruction, its trade and version linkage, currency-leg identification, current processing status and available rejection or failure reason.
 
Results may differ between the two legs. Missing references or unclear outcomes require investigation. SYS-SET remains the authoritative source for instruction processing status.]]></documentation>
