         <documentation id="documentation_b2fd1b12-c351-441d-9a1d-0bb0c33d2eca"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-002.
 
Purpose: Daily maturity population enriched with the outcome of the Trade Operations review.
 
Content: Trade and version references, contractual value dates, maturity status, lifecycle eligibility findings, and identified cancellations, inconsistences, or unresolved exceptions.
 
Produced by: Review trade versions and lifecycle eligibility.
 
Usage: Settlement Operations uses this population to determine the required settlement action. Only the subset classified as requiring settlement preparation is passed to validation of both currency legs.
 
The review does not confirm that settlement instructions have been submitted or that either leg has settled.]]></documentation>
