         <documentation id="documentation_b61ccc71-4390-4723-9500-ed0c7f5e98d4"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-ST-002; CSP-ST-007; CSP-RC-005.
 
Purpose: Persistent operational record used to support lifecycle review and follow-up of outstanding maturity and settlement items.
 
Content: Trade and version references, operational statuses, outstanding exceptions, assigned owner, supporting evidence references, and required next action.
 
Usage: Read during maturity-population review and updated by the relevant operational activities as investigation, settlement monitoring, and recovery progress. Tracker entries support operational coordination; confirmed settlement outcomes are established from the corresponding leg-level settlement evidence.]]></documentation>
