      <userTask name="Input and submit settlement instructions to SYS-SET"
                 id="_28b03f94-1c9b-4424-905f-66f62253d960"
                 isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_28b03f94-1c9b-4424-905f-66f62253d960"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-004.
 
Input: Prepared and validated settlement instruction details for both currency legs.
 
Handling: Input the controlled settlement details into SYS-SET and submit the required instructions through the existing operational interface. Preserve the originating trade identifier, accepted trade version and currency-leg identification.
 
Check existing instruction references and statuses before submission. Do not create a duplicate instruction for a leg that already has a valid instruction. Retain the available submission evidence and any immediate error or rejection infromation.
 
Output: Submitted settlement instruction details and available submission evidence for each affected currency leg. Submission does not itself confirm system acceptance or successful settlement.
 ]]></documentation>
