      <exclusiveGateway name="Is corrected settlement information available in time for the applicable cut-off?"
                         id="_6d4c724a-67e3-4f45-9723-357af980871e"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_6d4c724a-67e3-4f45-9723-357af980871e"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-PR-008.
 
Decision: Determine whether corrected settlement information is available with sufficient time remaining to revalidate both currency legs and complete the required instruction submission before the applicable cut-off.
 
Yes: Return the affected trade to settlement-detail validation. The availability of corrected information does not itself constitute validation approval.
 
No: Record and escalate the unresolved preparation exception. This includes cases where the required information remains unavailable or insufficient time remains to complete the required controls and submission.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
                                  type="ENUM"
                                  notebook="1"
                                  sourcelang=""
