      <endEvent name="Settlement preparation incomplete - exception escalated"
                 id="_8c8c28ed-4efc-4eb0-88a5-cac34a0ef6ec">
         <documentation id="documentation_8c8c28ed-4efc-4eb0-88a5-cac34a0ef6ec"><![CDATA[The current settlement preparation attempt for the affected trade has ended without completing the required preparation and submission steps.
 
The unresolved exception, operational status, assigned owner and required action have been recorded and escalated. Further remediation remains outstanding.
 
This outcome does not indicate successful settlement, cancellation of the trade or completion of its overall lifecycle. Other eligible trades may continue processing.]]></documentation>
