      <startEvent name="Daily maturity preparation cycle triggered"
                   id="_a21c61c6-9bdb-4544-829c-8fb9ddb36053">
         <documentation id="documentation_a21c61c6-9bdb-4544-829c-8fb9ddb36053"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CPS-ST-001; CSP-VQ-005.
 
Trigger: The scheduled daily maturity preparation cycle is reached.
 
Handling: Initiate production of the maturity population using the current SYS-FAP accounting-position state and contractual value dates. The baseline assumes a five-business-day preparation window; the applicable calendar and schedule require validation.
 
Output: Maturity population production initiated. This trigger does not imply that settlement is due today or that settlement instructions have already been created.]]></documentation>
