      <inclusiveGateway name="Which settlement actions are required?"
                         id="_a30afb21-2c09-41fb-8021-61ab0b0820d4"
                         default="_c8576694-c16f-47ab-be67-dc9c32a5f86c">
         <documentation id="documentation_a30afb21-2c09-41fb-8021-61ab0b0820d4"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-002.
 
Decision basis: Settlement action classification produced by Determine the required settlement action.
 
Routing: Activate each applicable branch when the reviewed population contains items requiring settlement preparation, monitoring of existing instructions, or investigation of lifecycle or settlement exceptions.
 
Multiple branches may be activated for different subsets of the same daily population. Each branch handles only the items assigned to its action category.
 
Default: Use No action required when the review established that no items require any of these actions. Incomplete or uncertain information must be classified for investigation.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
