      <exclusiveGateway name="Are settlement details complete and valid for both currency legs?"
                         id="_a5e1a05f-39f0-446e-b548-3ef843c4e3a4"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_a5e1a05f-39f0-446e-b548-3ef843c4e3a4"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004
 
Decision: Determine whether the settlement details for both currency legs of the trade have passed validation.
 
Yes: Both legs have complete and consistent settlement details, including currencies, amounts, value date, counterparty, settlement accounts and applicable instructions. Proceed to instruction preparation.
 
No: At least one required detail is missing, inconsistent or invalid. Route the affected trade to settlement preparation exception handling.
 
The decision applies to the individual trade and both of its currency legs. An exception on one trade does not automatically prevent other eligible trades from progressing.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
